</span><span id="S4.T6.5.4.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> <a href="https://github.com/GAIR-NLP/ToRL" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">GitHub</a> <img src="2509.02547v1/figures/hf-logo.png" id="S4.T6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:14/13;" width="14" height="13" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"> <a href="https://huggingface.co/GAIR/ToRL-7B" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">HuggingFace</a></span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T6.5.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T6.5.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T6.5.5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">ZeroTIR <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib306" title="" class="ltx_ref">306</a>]</cite></span></td>
<td id="S4.T6.5.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T6.5.5.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Outcome</span></td>
<td id="S4.T6.5.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="S4.T6.5.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block fas fa-github" aria-hidden="true">
</span><span id="S4.T6.5.5.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> <a href="https://github.com/yyht/openrlhf_async_pipline" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">GitHub</a> <img src="2509.02547v1/figures/hf-logo.png" id="S4.T6.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:14/13;" width="14" height="13" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"> <a href="https://huggingface.co/htxu91/zero-tir-7b-550step" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">HuggingFace</a></span></td></tr>
