</span><span id="S4.T8.11.6.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> <a href="https://github.com/togethercomputer/moa" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">GitHub</a></span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T8.11.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T8.11.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T8.11.7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">AFlow <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib429" title="" class="ltx_ref">429</a>]</cite></span></td>
