</span></td>
<td id="S5.T9.7.1.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S5.T9.7.1.5.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Text</span></td>
<td id="S5.T9.7.1.5.5" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">
<span id="S5.T9.7.1.5.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block fas fa-github" aria-hidden="true">
</span><span id="S5.T9.7.1.5.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><a href="https://github.com/allenai/ScienceWorld" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href" style="font-size:70%;">GitHub</a><span id="S5.T9.7.1.5.5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;"> </span>
<span id="S5.T9.7.1.5.5.4" class="ltx_inline-block fas fa-globe" aria-hidden="true">
