</span><span id="S5.T10.5.7.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> <a href="https://github.com/hiyouga/EasyR1" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">GitHub</a></span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T10.5.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T10.5.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S5.T10.5.8.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">AgentFly <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib502" title="" class="ltx_ref">502</a>]</cite></span></td>
<td id="S5.T10.5.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S5.T10.5.8.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Agentic RL</span></td>
<td id="S5.T10.5.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T10.5.8.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="S5.T10.5.8.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T10.5.8.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Scalable asynchronous execution</span></span>
